  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs (cubed)",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "3 tablespoon red curry paste",
    "2 teaspoon fresh ginger (minced)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "2 tablespoon fish sauce",
    "4 tablespoon peanut butter",
    "6 ounce canned coconut milk",
    "1 cup chicken broth",
    "2 tablespoon lime juice",
    "8 drop liquid stevia",
    "8 ounce cauliflower rice",
    "1/4 cup peanuts (crushed)",
    "2 tablespoon fresh cilantro (chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Heat butter and olive oil in a pan until butter is starting to fry. Add curry paste, ginger, and garlic to the pan and cook in the oil until fragrant. About 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Thai-Massaman-Curry-with-Chicken-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in chicken to the pan and let cook through. About 6-8 minutes on medium heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Thai-Massaman-Curry-with-Chicken-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the meantime, get together your other ingredients. Measure out the peanut butter, fish sauce, coconut milk, sucralose and chicken stock.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Thai-Massaman-Curry-with-Chicken-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once chicken is cooked through, add in the measured ingredients from the previous step. Bring to a boil then reduce to medium low.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Thai-Massaman-Curry-with-Chicken-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let simmer for 2-3 minutes, then add in the cauliflower. Simmer for an additional 20 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Keto-Thai-Massaman-Curry-with-Chicken-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once finished, add lime juice and stir together. Serve with some chopped cilantro and crushed peanuts over the top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-thai-massaman-curry-with-chicken/#wprm-recipe-55040-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
